{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01379",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 5.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.72,
      "end_seconds": 12.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.06,
      "end_seconds": 19.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Um, hello, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.3,
      "end_seconds": 25.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down we'll go through it together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.8,
      "end_seconds": 35.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "I'm here because of a stinging pain. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.77,
      "end_seconds": 38.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.71,
      "end_seconds": 45.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Probably about a week. Yeah. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.87,
      "end_seconds": 52.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.1,
      "end_seconds": 56.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.19,
      "end_seconds": 61.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.53,
      "end_seconds": 87.59,
      "duration_seconds": 25.06,
      "text": "It usually comes with a blister. The blister? That's been for five days. And a burn on my left forearm, too. As for burn on my left forearm, touching it and clothes definitely sets it off. There was redness around it, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 89.61,
      "end_seconds": 96.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Heart rate 82, respiratory rate 18. Pressure 125 over 70, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.8,
      "end_seconds": 100.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.27,
      "end_seconds": 107.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "I'd like to to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.82,
      "end_seconds": 120.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.39,
      "end_seconds": 125.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.59,
      "end_seconds": 151.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "there is a five-centimetre area of redness with an intact blister on the left forearm, and it blanches and is painful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.08,
      "end_seconds": 153.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "yes, that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.88,
      "end_seconds": 160.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.42,
      "end_seconds": 175.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Did you get numbness at the burn or burn on the face?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.63,
      "end_seconds": 182.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "no, no numbness at the burn or burn on the face"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.38,
      "end_seconds": 188.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or trouble breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.19,
      "end_seconds": 191.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.87,
      "end_seconds": 197.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pus or chemical exposure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.99,
      "end_seconds": 203.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "No pus or chemical exposure, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.62,
      "end_seconds": 207.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Right, right. Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.03,
      "end_seconds": 211.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.37,
      "end_seconds": 214.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.62,
      "end_seconds": 226.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "Tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night. Sorry, what was I saying, I'm on alendronate, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.25,
      "end_seconds": 234.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.72,
      "end_seconds": 237.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "70 milligrams"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.49,
      "end_seconds": 241.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.01,
      "end_seconds": 248.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.43,
      "end_seconds": 263.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.09,
      "end_seconds": 271.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "I've got an enlarged prostate. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.09,
      "end_seconds": 276.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Alright, is that that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.91,
      "end_seconds": 279.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "I have thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.04,
      "end_seconds": 294.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.96,
      "text": "mm, okay alright, an enlarged prostate, that matches what I have here have you got any known allergies? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.39,
      "end_seconds": 299.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 300.03,
      "end_seconds": 308.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "Actually, I remember he had some kind of reaction to amoxicillin before. I couldn't swear to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.53,
      "end_seconds": 311.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "really? I don't think so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.74,
      "end_seconds": 321.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "alright, fair enough, I'll write down both versions and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.05,
      "end_seconds": 326.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.68,
      "end_seconds": 330.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.32,
      "end_seconds": 335.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.54,
      "end_seconds": 346.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking i can't pin this down yet we're looking at a superficial partial-thickness burn or a deeper burn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.58,
      "end_seconds": 351.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.09,
      "end_seconds": 384.79,
      "duration_seconds": 31.7,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a superficial partial-thickness burn, and we'll watch how it goes. Let's use paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. You take it by mouth. That's for burn pain. Cool the area under running water for twenty minutes and cover it with a non-stick dressing, and leave the blister alone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.7,
      "end_seconds": 398.72,
      "duration_seconds": 13.02,
      "text": "try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit i'll want another look in three days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.36,
      "end_seconds": 401.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.89,
      "end_seconds": 406.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.17,
      "end_seconds": 417.19,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "so, I take the paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed and come back in three days is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.0,
      "end_seconds": 425.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.4,
      "end_seconds": 429.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.05,
      "end_seconds": 431.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}